<title>USA: Blowout names Berkompas CFO.</title>
<headline>Blowout names Berkompas CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BlowOut Entertainment said Thomas Berkompas was named Chief Financial Officer, replacing Karl Wetzel.</p>
<p>Berkompas, a certified public accountant, most recently served as Chief Financial Officer, Secretary and Treasurer of Western Power &amp; Equipment Corp, a construction equipment company.</p>
